# Research Prompt Builder — North Star

Research Prompt Builder remains Live through research-prompt export. Content Intelligence is the next independent domain: Librarian (Partial) ingests completed external research into a governed library; Topic Engine is Planned and must consume only `PublishedLibraryDto`.

RPB work must still support Accuracy · Specificity · Research Depth · Repeatability of the exported research prompt.

## Do not expand into

In-app research execution · Topic Engine (until its PR) · scripts · video · auth · cloud DB · RAG/multi-agent · write MCP · auto-rewriting canon docs · runtime-import of Reference transcripts

## First steps

1. Prefer `npm run dev` (runs `doctor` then Next.js). Use `npm run doctor` alone for a one-shot check; `npm run verify` before merge.
2. Read `AGENTS.md` and `project-knowledge/CURRENT_STATE.md`
3. Prefer the smallest change that improves the exported prompt or the Librarian foundation without co-mingling domains
